 "beatLines": [
  {
   "day": 1,
   "tag": "table",
   "text": "You wake up with dirt in your mouth and blood on your hands that isn't yours. The sky is the wrong color — not sunset-wrong, wound-wrong. Jorge Ferrari. Electrician. From Columbus, Ohio. That was yesterday. This is now. You have: Beat-up Paperback, Grandma's Tin Cup, Seed packet, Knife roll, Carpenter's square. That's everything you own in this world. Haven. Twelve people. The fire is lit. You heard it in the dark. Breathing. Not yours. It knew your name — it said it wrong, like it learned the shape of the sound but not what it meant."
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "tag": "slot60",
   "text": "◈ THE TRIAL — the audience is restless. The System offers Jorge a trial, broadcast live. Survive it and take the slot. Refuse it and... well. The audience remembers refusals. (Ability slots: 4)"
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "tag": "sentiment-lesson",
   "text": "◈ RESONANCE HARMONICS — SYSTEM: \"HYPOTHESIS CONFIRMED. Objects with high observer-attention waveforms function as auxiliary capacitors. We call this RESONANCE HARMONICS. We do not know why the waveforms taste like grief. We have stopped asking.\" — Hold a keepsake. Think about them. The System will do the math. (It is not math. It is love. The System will never know.) Channel keepsakes from your pack."
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "tag": "demo",
   "text": "SYSTEM: \"DEMONSTRATION. Give me that — Beat-up Paperback. WATCH.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 15,
   "tag": "channel",
   "text": "💛 You hold Beat-up Paperback and practice — one gift, deeply. They would want you to get better at this. (+6 experience to Gossip Network)"
  },
  {
   "day": 16,
   "tag": "channel",
   "text": "💛 You hold Beat-up Paperback. Breathe. The shaking eases. (−6 trauma)"
  },
  {
   "day": 16,
   "tag": "channel",
   "text": "💛 You hold Grandma's Tin Cup. Breathe. The shaking eases. (−6 trauma)"
  }
 ],
